{
  "id": 8834824896711,
  "title": "Personalized Hunting and Outdoor Comforter with Deer Antlers",
  "handle": "personalized-hunting-and-outdoor-comforter-with-deer-antlers-4e13e688e0-4e13e688e0",
  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate your shared love for the great outdoors with this personalized deer hunting couple quilt set. Designed by Jeminise, this cozy quilt captures the spirit of wildlife romance, making it a thoughtful gift for couples, outdoor enthusiasts, or a special treat for your own home bedding collection.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customizable options including one text input to add names, dates, or a personal message, along with space for up to six custom images.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Crafted from a soft, breathable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester with a high-quality silk floss filling for lightweight warmth in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor bed or sofa lounging, or as a cozy layer for outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete Set Options:</strong> Includes one quilt with the option to add two matching pillowcases to complete your rustic bedroom decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water for quick cleaning and convenient maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Deer Couple-07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + 2 Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
